[finding] f-023 Tool check: predict_recoil at m_chi = 1100 GeV, delta = 0 (higgsino Z couplings, auto sigma_n = 7.43e-39 cm^2) predicts about 1.10e7 events in the LZ extended N
**Finding:** Tool check: predict_recoil at m_chi = 1100 GeV, delta = 0 (higgsino Z couplings, auto sigma_n = 7.43e-39 cm^2) predicts about 1.10e7 events in the LZ extended NR search against 1 observed. Elastic Z-mediated (Dirac-like) higgsino scattering is therefore excluded by about 7 orders of magnitude, and a neutral splitting is required to switch it off kinematically.
